      "text": "Key Takeaways"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 10,
      "heading_id": "heading_00002",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Am I pregnant or is it PMS?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 22,
      "heading_id": "heading_00003",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Quiz: Am I pregnant?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 23,
      "heading_id": "heading_00004",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "1. Is your period late?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 30,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2. Have you been experiencing mood swings?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 36,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3. Have you been feeling nauseous?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 42,
      "heading_id": "heading_00007",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "4. Have you noticed any unusual spotting?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 47,
      "heading_id": "heading_00008",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "5. Are your boobs feeling more tender?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 53,
      "heading_id": "heading_00009",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "6. Have you noticed any nipple changes?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 59,
      "heading_id": "heading_00010",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "7. Are you constipated or bloated?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 65,
      "heading_id": "heading_00011",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "9. Do you have food cravings?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 70,
      "heading_id": "heading_00012",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "10. Are you more tired than usual?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 76,
      "heading_id": "heading_00013",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Do all women get early pregnancy symptoms?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 79,
      "heading_id": "heading_00014",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "When to see your doctor"
    },
    {
